WEBVTT

1
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Dive log, day nine. Heading for the anomaly near the KALPA facility.

2
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.500
Depth nine hundred. Pressure nominal. I'm cleared to dock afterwards.

3
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.800
Nobody will tell me what they actually do down there.

4
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.500
Big signal. Biological. It's coming from inside the structure.

5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.500
The anomaly is a whale. It has to be a whale, near the lab.

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.500
Control, this is Rao, navigation is down, I can't—

7
00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Comms? Comms!

8
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.200
Pipe burst! Pipe burst—

9
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.000
Cabin's flooding. Something's pulling us toward the— what is that?

10
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.800
It's opening. It's opening like a mouth.

11
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.000
Not like this.

